<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was very slow late Friday. There were not enough slaughter steer or heifer sales confirmed for an adequate market test at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was light. Sales confirmed on 100 slaughter steers and no slaughter heifers. This week's confirmed sales 41,100 head confirmed including 12,700 head or about 31 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Steers - few select with end choice 2-3 1200 lbs</p>
<p>Brahma-cross 71.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed: 100     week ago: 400	 year ago: 1200</p>
